{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08479","headline":"送于十八应四子举落第还嵩山 · 李白","name":"送于十八应四子举落第还嵩山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾祖吹橐龠，天人信森罗。\n归根复太素，羣动熙元和。\n炎炎四真人，摛辩若涛波。\n交流无时寂，杨墨日成科。\n夫子闻洛诵，夸才才固多。\n爲金好踊跃，久客方蹉跎。\n道可束卖之，五宝溢山河。\n劝君还嵩丘，开酌盼庭柯。\n三花如未落，乘兴一来过。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08479.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08479","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}